Simple greeting app — ask name & age, print a personalized message

Question1
Concepts used:
 print(),
 input(),
 variables,
 string formatting (f-strings)
Problem Statement

Write a Python program that:
1.Asks the user to enter their name.
2.Asks the user to enter their age.
3.Asks the user to enter their favorite hobby.
4.Prints a personalized greeting message using all three inputs.

Example Run:
Enter your name: Arun
Enter your age: 22
Enter your favorite hobby: cricket

Output:
Hello Arun! 👋
You are 22 years old.
Wow, cricket is awesome! Keep enjoying it.

